cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The PIC Evidence Room"
message: >-
  If you use these figures, methods, or code, please cite this repository. Cite the
  version you used — the underlying federal series are revised, so a figure quoted
  without a date is not reproducible.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Polymer Industry Cluster, Greater Akron Chamber"
    city: Akron
    region: Ohio
    country: US
    website: "https://picinnovation.org"
repository-code: "https://github.com/polymerindustrycluster/evidence-room"
url: "https://polymerindustrycluster.github.io/evidence-room/"
abstract: >-
  Interactive analyses of the Northeast Ohio polymer economy, built entirely from free
  public federal data. Each page names its sources and exact filter values, ships the
  script that produced its dataset, and carries a claims file in which every published
  sentence is a re-runnable assertion with a stated falsification condition. Methods
  and known limits are documented in _data/METHODS-SOP.md; changes to published figures
  are logged in CORRECTIONS.md.
keywords:
  - polymers
  - plastics
  - regional economics
  - industry cluster
  - data journalism
  - reproducible research
  - Northeast Ohio
license: MIT
license-url: "https://github.com/polymerindustrycluster/evidence-room/blob/main/LICENSE"
